<</Title(Decoder: The decoder also consists of recurrent units, usually the same type as those in the encoder. It takes the context vector produced by the encoder as input and generates the output sequence step by step. The decoder's hidden state at each step ...)/Dest[11 0 R/XYZ 69 175 0]/Parent 904 0 R/Prev 919 0 R/Next 921 0 R>>
