endobj

923 0 obj
<</Title(Decoder: Similarly, the decoder also employs LSTM cells for processing the context vector and generating the output sequence. LSTMs in the decoder allow for better retention of context and handling of long sequences during decoding.)/Dest[12 0 R/XYZ 69 656 0]/Parent 904 0 R/Prev 922 0 R/Next 924 0 R>>
endobj

